      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>Kisses the ground and reports that the slave is a pauper</li>\n<li>and he has a family, and this [his state of poverty] is not usual, for the sake of God the Almighty</li>\n<li>look into his affair, for the sake of God the Almighty</li>\n<li>The slave</li>\n<li>Ibr\u0101h\u012bm b. Mu\u1e25sin (?)</li>\n<li>And Y\u016bsuf, the Arab</li></ol>\n",
